  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Professional Competencies of ASF Staff</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop and strengthen the capabilities of the ASF&apos;s staff through the creation of a comprehensive learning program which will provide a framework for professional certification of the governmental auditors in line with professional international certification standards. The development objective of this grant is to support the institutional strengthening of Mexico Supreme Audit Institution (Auditoria Superior de la Federacioncomma ASF by its name in Spanish) through the development of a learning program (which will also be piloted during implementation of the grant) to enhance professional competencies of its staff. The learning program would focus on the ASFs key audit areas and would include an internal certification to demonstrate satisfactory completion of the learning program.</narrative>
  </description>
